        "description": "Monitors cache hit vs miss rates and sentinel defenses. During a stampede, misses spike sharply; under mutex, misses drop to exactly 1.",
        "id": 1,
        "links": [],
        "title": "Cache Observability: Hits vs Misses vs Sentinel Protections (req/sec)",
